1c:Tbf2,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Is APKPure safe?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Relatively safe compared with random APK sites, but not as safe as Google Play Store. APKPure checks developer signatures to make sure a file was not altered, but that check cannot detect an app that is malicious from its own developer, and it is not the same as Play Protect malware scanning. Use it carefully, and keep Play Protect switched on."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is APKPure safe now, after the 2021 incident?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The 2021 infection was in version 3.17.18 of the APKPure app. Kaspersky reported it on 8 April 2021, APKPure released the fix as version 3.17.19, and Kaspersky confirmed the new version was clean. The incident is history - it does not prove APKPure is infected today - but it also does not make the store safe forever. Treat every download with the same checks."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is APKPure legal?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Installing apps from outside Play Store - sideloading - is not a crime. Downloading a free app that is genuinely free is generally legal. Downloading a paid app for free is software piracy, whatever the platform. APKPure's policy is to refuse pirated apps, but with the volume it handles, some can slip through - so avoid any 'paid app for free' offer."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the difference between APKPure and Google Play Store?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Play Store reviews apps, verifies developer identities, and scans for malware with Play Protect, but generally only offers the latest version of apps released in your country. APKPure offers old versions and apps across regions through signature verification, but without Play Store's review depth or malware scanning."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why does Play Protect warn me when I install from APKPure?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Because that is Android's standard policy for every app installed from outside Play Store - not a verdict that the file is malware. The warning reminds you the install skipped the official route: read it, check the app's permissions, and continue only if you trust the source."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does APKPure offer paid apps for free?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"According to its policy, no - APKPure says it refuses pirated apps. If you find a paid app offered for free under APKPure's name, treat it as piracy or a lookalike site, and do not download it."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"I already installed an app from APKPure - what should I check?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Check its permissions in Settings, run a Play Protect scan, and watch for strange behaviour such as aggressive ads, a draining battery, or odd new permission requests. If anything looks wrong, uninstall the app. Our Permission Checker can help you read an app's permissions from a screenshot if you are unsure."}}]}12:["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-8 py-8","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home (EN)\",\"item\":\"https://cekapk.com/en\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Is APKPure Safe? Security Risks, APK Checks & Safety Tips\",\"item\":\"https://cekapk.com/en/panduan/apakah-apkpure-aman\"}]}"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$1c"}}],"$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25","$L26"]}]
1d:["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"Is APKPure Safe? Security Risks, APK Checks & Safety Tips\",\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https://cekapk.com/#org\"},\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://cekapk.com/#org\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-11-07\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-11-07\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":\"https://cekapk.com/en/panduan/apakah-apkpure-aman\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"}"}}]
1e:["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"HowTo\",\"name\":\"How to Use Google Play Protect\",\"step\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"name\":\"Open Google Play Store\",\"text\":\"Open the Play Store app on your Android phone.\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"name\":\"Tap the profile icon\",\"text\":\"Tap your profile picture or initial at the top right of the screen.\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"name\":\"Select Play Protect\",\"text\":\"Tap Play Protect in the menu to open the safety overview.\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"name\":\"Run a scan\",\"text\":\"Tap Scan to check the apps on your device right now. Play Protect also scans automatically in the background.\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"name\":\"Keep app scanning enabled\",\"text\":\"In Play Protect settings, keep 'Scan apps with Play Protect' switched on, so new installs - including sideloaded ones - are checked. Play Protect may also offer to send an unknown app to Google for a deeper check before you install it.\"}]}"}}]
1f:["$","nav",null,{"aria-label":"Breadcrumb","className":"text-sm text-ink/60","children":["$","ol",null,{"className":"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1","children":[["$","li","/en",{"className":"flex items-center gap-1","children":[false,["$","$L5",null,{"href":"/en","className":"hover:text-primary-dark","children":"English Home"}]]}],["$","li","/en",{"className":"flex items-center gap-1","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":true,"children":"/"}],["$","$L5",null,{"href":"/en","className":"hover:text-primary-dark","children":"Guides"}]]}],["$","li","/en/panduan/apakah-apkpure-aman",{"className":"flex items-center gap-1","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":true,"children":"/"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-current":"page","className":"font-medium text-ink","children":"Is APKPure Safe? Security Risks, APK Checks & Safety Tips"}]]}]]}]}]
20:["$","header",null,{"children":[["$","h1",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-extrabold text-ink sm:text-3xl","children":"Is APKPure Safe? Security Risks, APK Checks & Safety Tips"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm text-ink/55","children":["Last checked: ","2026-11-07"," — English edition"]}]]}]
21:["$","section",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","p","Is APKPure safe to download Andr",{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/85","children":"Is APKPure safe to download Android apps? Learn about its security history, APK verification, potential risks, and practical ways to protect your device."}],["$","p","The short answer: APKPure is saf",{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/85","children":"The short answer: APKPure is safer than a random APK download site, because it checks that each file carries the original developer's signature - but it is not as safe as Google Play Store, and no honest guide can call it fully safe. Its own app was once infected with malware in 2021, and the store's checks cannot catch an app that is malicious from its own developer. This guide explains what APKPure is, what really happened in 2021, what its checks can and cannot do, and how to protect your phone if you use it."}],["$","p","This is an explainer, not a stor",{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/85","children":"This is an explainer, not a store: there is no download button here. Everything below comes from independent security research (Kaspersky, 2021), Google's own guidance, and APKPure's own statements - the sources are listed at the end, and the two kinds of evidence are kept apart."}]]}]
